{
 "encounter_id": "00816",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello, doctor. I'm back about my ear. It's still leaking, and I'm worried, because of my diabetes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which ear, and what's been coming out?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The left. A yellowish discharge. It's been going on for two weeks, and the drops I was given didn't clear it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it painful?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A dull ache. Not like before. And I can't hear well on that side."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or dizziness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. No dizziness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any swelling or pain behind the ear?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing behind it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Remind me what you've been using."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The antibiotic drops, ciprofloxacin, three drops, twice a day, for ten days. And my diabetes tablet, metformin, 500 mg, twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Right. And how's your sugar been? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit high. Last time my nurse said eight-something. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes, five years, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me look in your ear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Gently, please.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The ear canal is swollen and has yellowish debris and discharge in it, and the eardrum is hard to see, but I can see a small hole in it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A hole? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A perforation of the eardrum, which would explain the discharge, and it may have come from an old middle-ear infection. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh dear. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very treatable. I'd like to arrange a swab from the ear, to see which germ is growing, and a hearing test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Diabetes can make ear infections harder to clear, so I'd like you to check your sugars twice a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Keep the ear dry, use a cotton wool ball with petroleum jelly in the ear when you shower, and don't swim."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. I don't swim anyway. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in a week, with the swab result."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A week. Should I stop the drops? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Finish the course as prescribed, and don't use anyone else's. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right, I'll finish them. Thank you, doctor. ~"
  }
 ],
